    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFhcd9ICWBcUAQb3tOREunMBZYsee3AxcUHJby1LPTNop9Yp0_HK9BBFjN4CTpCYUSrdkxsC6jRhLldeUDdgMiFgw2O3pTYDHS10vNH5KhHdhjokiH3qkxQfzTOQf9F0lfSZibrwUgaIwI/s1600/217.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgFhcd9ICWBcUAQb3tOREunMBZYsee3AxcUHJby1LPTNop9Yp0_HK9BBFjN4CTpCYUSrdkxsC6jRhLldeUDdgMiFgw2O3pTYDHS10vNH5KhHdhjokiH3qkxQfzTOQf9F0lfSZibrwUgaIwI/s1600/217.jpg\" width=\"456\" /></a></div>\n<br />\n\n\n<div class=\"p2\"><b><span class=\"s1\"><span style=\"color: red;\">217期</span></span><span style=\"color: red;\">目&nbsp; 錄</span></b></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">2011年阿却賞</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">柯柏榮/詩人</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">王薈雯/十三、十五hia（三）</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">做伙來唸詩</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">亞茱/記念懷念鄭南榕先生</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">台文青年</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">林昀樺/Tī城市ê邊界</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">洪莞紜/舞</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/05/eve-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">楊芷緹/Eve ê 新娘衫</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/05/blog-post.html\" target=\"_blank\">陳韻伃/厝</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/05/e.html\" target=\"_blank\">蔡承甫/咱ê母語咱ê話一个高中生對母語保存ê看法</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">基金會十五周年</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">林皙陽/李江却台語文教基金會成立十五周年感謝ê話</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">光景bóng uē</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">Tan,Uichi/來去香港（一）－－「繁華」夜都市？</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">逐家來phò-tāu</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">林漢森/「Tām-sám會」手記 第一攤</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">台灣人寫真</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">鄭同僚/蕃薯蔡/魔神仔相片</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">陳隆/陳錦芳/盧榮杰/世界台灣同鄉會聯合會 (世台會) 簡史（三）</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">楊振裕/萬居--a擔埔社（頂pha）</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\"><a href=\"http://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2012/05/sui-epha.html\" target=\"_blank\">藍春瑞/上suí ê查某（下pha）</a></span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">台羅會交流道</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">張學謙/Tio̍h大膽向前行：雙語教育ê必要性</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">楊允言/台灣到底有幾間台語相關系所？</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">Siraya批信</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">Pais Abiki Ngá-î/Kapulong仙姑祖千秋日﹙二﹚</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\">Saⁿ-kap讀小說</span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"background-color: yellow;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">黃文宏/菩薩榮--ā成佛 （七）</span></div><div class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\"></span><br /></div><div class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s1\">施俊州/Hibálih姑娘（二）</span></div>"
